<tr><td>Simple concept or massing model</td><td>10-14 days</td><td>Simplified buildings, limited colors and minimal landscape detail</td></tr>
<tr><td>Standard architectural presentation model</td><td>Approximately 10-21 days</td><td>Developed architecture, site context, landscaping and presentation-quality finishes</td></tr>
