<tr><td>Large masterplan model</td><td>21–45 days</td><td>Multiple buildings, roads, terrain, landscaping and development phases</td></tr>
<tr><td>Large sectional model for transportation</td><td>21–45 days</td><td>Modular construction, fitted connections, protective crates and coordinated installation</td></tr>
<tr><td>Façade or material study model</td><td>10–14 days</td><td>Larger scale, material studies, depth, shadow and façade assemblies</td></tr>
</tbody>
